YuNet (face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx)
Copyright (c) 2020 Shiqi Yu
Licensed under the MIT License (LICENSE beside this file).
https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_detection_yunet
Trained on WIDER FACE: https://github.com/ShiqiYu/libfacedetection.train

SFace (face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx)
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE beside this file).
https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface
OpenCV does not say which data these weights were trained on; the SFace paper
(https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.12010) trains on CASIA-WebFace, VGGFace2 and
MS-Celeb-1M. See https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/issues/313.

Modified by the Stratus project (https://github.com/stratus-private-cloud/stratus-backend):
the weights SFace listed among its inputs were made constants, and both models
were converted to the ONNX Runtime format. The recipe is
build/embed/model/faces.py.
